---
intent: >
  Bring the provisionBrain code in line with the rewritten spec. Move the
  scaffolded brain.aide path from `.aide/brain.aide` to `.aide/config/brain.aide`,
  collapse `obsidianBrainAideTemplate` to the minimal two-field frontmatter
  (`name` + `mcpServerConfig`) using `@bitbonsai/mcpvault` and an inline path
  (no `${rootPath}`), codify the `.aide/config/` directory-wide
  no-overwrite invariant, and rewrite the orchestrator + template tests so
  the round-trip (template → parseBrainAide → interpolateArgs → MCP entry)
  reflects the new minimal schema. Idempotency semantics stay exactly the
  same: presence-only seed semantic for the brain config and vault seed
  files; canonical-derived check (vs. derived entry) for the brain MCP step.
---

